{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0227","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000031:text","row":30595,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"受け入れる？","en":"Accept it?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801397","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00001","en":"Accept it?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000055:text","row":30596,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"死を、この俺が？","en":"Death? Me, of all people?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801398","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00002","en":"Me? Death?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:0000007d:text","row":30597,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"まさか、と思うのだ。","en":"Impossible, I think.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801399","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00003","en":"Absurd, I think.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:000000a9:text","row":30598,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"自分が死を肯定できるとは思えない。","en":"I can't imagine myself affirming death.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801400","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00004","en":"I don't think I would be able to consent to my own death.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["addition","overinterpretation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:000000e3:text","row":30599,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"生存への本能は強い方だ。","en":"My survival instinct is strong.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801401","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00005","en":"The instinct to exist is very strong.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"生存への本能 is the established concept 'survival instinct.' 'Instinct to exist' is an awkward literal paraphrase.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":21,"start":4,"text":"instinct to exist"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000113:text","row":30600,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"砂漠の虫みたいに、しぶといはず。","en":"I'm supposed to be as tenacious as a desert insect.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801402","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00006","en":"As tenacious, likely, as an insect in the desert.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:0000014b:text","row":30601,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"それに、霧が向けてくる憎悪が、俺にははかりかねた。","en":"And I cannot fathom the hatred Kiri directs at me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801403","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00007","en":"Besides, the hatred that came from Kiri was something I didn't really know what to do with.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"はかりかねた means that he could not fathom or gauge the hatred directed at him. The English instead says he did not know how to respond to or handle it.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":90,"start":56,"text":"didn't really know what to do with"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000195:text","row":30602,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"不意に、腹が立った。","en":"Suddenly, I'm angry.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801404","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00008","en":"Unexpectedly, I grew annoyed.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:000001c1:text","row":30603,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"生きるべきなのに。","en":"When we ought to live.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801405","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00009","en":"I should be living, but,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:000001eb:text","row":30604,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"絶望しかないのに。","en":"When there is nothing but despair.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801406","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00010","en":"there's nothing but despair, so,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation"],"assessment":"The repeated のに is concessive: even though there is nothing but despair. 'So' makes despair the cause of the adjoining obligation and reverses the relation.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":31,"start":29,"text":"so"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000215:text","row":30605,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"笑っていかねばならないのに。","en":"When we have to keep smiling.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801407","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00011","en":"I should just laugh, yet...","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","undertranslation"],"assessment":"笑っていかねばならない means that he nevertheless must go on smiling. The English reduces this sustained stance to merely laughing and adds 'just.'","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":19,"start":0,"text":"I should just laugh"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000295:text","row":30606,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧……やめよう」","en":"“Kiri... let's stop.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801408","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00012","en":"Taichi: \"Kiri... let's stop.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:000002bf:text","row":30607,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"一歩、前に出る。","en":"I take one step forward.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801409","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00013","en":"I take one step... forwards.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:0000030e:text","row":30608,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「今は、殺し合ってる場合じゃないだろ？」","en":"“This isn't the time for us to kill each other, is it?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801410","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00014","en":"Taichi: \"This here, isn't it just a case of mutual murder?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that now is not the time for them to kill each other. The English instead affirms that the situation is simply a case of mutual murder.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":58,"start":20,"text":"isn't it just a case of mutual murder?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:0000034e:text","row":30609,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"一歩、前に出る。","en":"I take one step forward.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801411","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00015","en":"I take one step... forwards.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:0000039d:text","row":30610,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺が嫌いなのはわかったよ、けどだからって殺し合いは」","en":"“I understand that you hate me. But even so, killing each other...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801412","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00016","en":"Taichi: \"You hate me, I get it, but still, now, killing each other,\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:000003eb:text","row":30611,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"一歩、前に出る。","en":"I take one step forward.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801413","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00017","en":"I take one step... forwards.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:0000043a:text","row":30612,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「ナンセンスじゃないか」","en":"“It's nonsense.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801414","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00018","en":"Taichi: \"it's nonsense innit.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["addition","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:0000046a:text","row":30613,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"一歩、前に出る。","en":"I take one step forward.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801415","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00019","en":"I take one step... forwards.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:0000049a:text","row":30614,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「それにお互いのためにならない。君だって危険なんだ」","en":"“And it won't help either of us. You're in danger, too.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801416","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Besides, this won't be good for each other. Even you're in danger.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","word_choice"],"assessment":"君だって means that Kiri is in danger too. 'Even you' marks her inclusion as surprising rather than adding her to the shared risk.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":75,"start":53,"text":"Even you're in danger."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:000004e6:text","row":30615,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"もし、曜子ちゃんが見ていたら。","en":"If Yoko were watching.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801417","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00021","en":"Supposing Youko-chan was looking,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:0000051c:text","row":30616,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"霧は一秒後には死ぬかも知れない。","en":"Kiri might be dead one second from now.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801418","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00022","en":"Kiri could even die the very next second, perhaps.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000554:text","row":30617,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"けど、どうやって説明したらいいのか。","en":"But how can I explain it?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801419","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00023","en":"But... how could I even explain this to her?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000590:text","row":30618,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"彼女のこわさを。","en":"How dangerous she is.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801420","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00024","en":"How terrifying she is...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:000005b8:text","row":30619,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"俺は焦る。","en":"I panic.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801421","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00025","en":"I grow impatient.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:000005da:text","row":30620,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"つい、踏み込みすぎた。","en":"I go too far.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801422","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00026","en":"Accidentally, I treaded too far into her territory.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","addition","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The Japanese says figuratively that he went too far. The English uses the nonstandard past 'treaded' and invents a literal territory.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":50,"start":14,"text":"I treaded too far into her territory"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000610:text","row":30621,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「豊のことは―――」","en":"“About Yutaka—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801423","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00027","en":"Taichi: \"Yutaka was---\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:0000065f:text","row":30622,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「―――ッ！！」","en":"“—!!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801424","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00028","en":"Kiri: \"---!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000743:text","row":30623,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"軽く鳴った。空気が。","en":"It rings lightly. The air.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801425","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00029","en":"A light ringing. Of the air.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:000007f2:text","row":30624,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"ちょうど俺の胸部に、黒々とした矢が冗談のように刺さっていた。","en":"A pitch-black arrow is lodged squarely in my chest, like some kind of joke.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801426","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00030","en":"As if a joke, a dark black bolt was stuck precisely in the middle of my chest.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:0000084e:text","row":30625,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「うあ……」","en":"“Uah...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801427","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00031","en":"Taichi: \"Gwoh...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000872:text","row":30626,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"しくじった。","en":"I messed up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801428","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00032","en":"Fail.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["register_voice","grammar"],"assessment":"しくじった is a finite admission that he made a mistake or screwed up. The English uses a bare internet-style label or command.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":5,"start":0,"text":"Fail."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000896:text","row":30627,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"撃たれたというショックから、その場に座り込む。","en":"The shock of being shot makes me sink down where I stand.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801429","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00033","en":"I fell down sitting on the spot from the shock that was being struck.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that he sits down from the shock of having been shot. The English substitutes being struck, makes the shock itself progressive, and forms no grammatical causal phrase.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":68,"start":37,"text":"the shock that was being struck"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:000008dc:text","row":30628,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"苦痛がない。","en":"There is no pain.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801430","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00034","en":"Agony there isn't.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese plainly says there is no pain. The English raises it to agony and uses an unnatural existential inversion.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":18,"start":0,"text":"Agony there isn't."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000900:text","row":30629,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"全然、不自然なほどない。","en":"None at all. Unnaturally none.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801431","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00035","en":"None at all, unnaturally so.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000930:text","row":30630,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"死が近いとも感じられない。","en":"I cannot even feel death approaching.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801432","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00036","en":"I cannot even feel if death is coming closer.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that he cannot feel death drawing near. The English instead says he cannot determine whether it is approaching.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":44,"start":2,"text":"cannot even feel if death is coming closer"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000962:text","row":30631,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"まいったな、これは……苦しむぞ？","en":"This is bad... I'm going to suffer, aren't I?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801433","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00037","en":"Oh, I give up, is this... suffering?","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation","grammar"],"assessment":"Taichi recognizes that this is bad and anticipates suffering. The English says he gives up and then asks whether the present situation itself is 'suffering.'","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":36,"start":0,"text":"Oh, I give up, is this... suffering?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000a30:text","row":30632,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"ゆっくりと横倒しになる。","en":"Slowly, I topple onto my side.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801434","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00038","en":"Slowly I begin to topple sideways.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000a60:text","row":30633,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"机の森の中、俺は倒れた。","en":"I fall among a forest of desks.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801435","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00039","en":"I collapsed in the midst of a forest of desks.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000a90:text","row":30634,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"霧が見えなくなる。","en":"Kiri disappears from view.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801436","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00040","en":"I cannot see Kiri anymore.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000ac2:text","row":30635,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「……はっ……はっ……はっ……」","en":"“...Hah... hah... hah...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801437","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00041","en":"Taichi: \"...hah... ...hah... ...hah...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000afa:text","row":30636,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"浅い呼吸。","en":"Shallow breaths.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801438","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00042","en":"Shallow breathing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000b1c:text","row":30637,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"まだ死なないのか。","en":"Am I not dead yet?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801439","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00043","en":"Am I still not dead yet?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000b46:text","row":30638,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"大きな苦しみが近づいてくるのがわかる。","en":"I can feel great suffering drawing near.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801440","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00044","en":"I know that great suffering is approaching me.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000b84:text","row":30639,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"……ああ、いやだ。","en":"...Oh, no.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801441","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00045","en":"...ahhh, that's bad.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","register_voice"],"assessment":"いやだ expresses that he does not want this or cannot bear it. The English merely evaluates the situation as bad.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":19,"start":9,"text":"that's bad"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000bae:text","row":30640,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"即死は幸せなんだと知る。","en":"I learn that instant death is a mercy.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801442","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00046","en":"I recognize now that instant death is happiness.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000be6:text","row":30641,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「はっはっはっはっはっはっ―――」","en":"“Hah hah hah hah hah hah—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801443","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00047","en":"Taichi: \"HahHahHahHahHahHah---\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000c20:text","row":30642,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"気がつくと、呼吸が恐ろしく浅くなっている。","en":"By the time I notice, my breathing has become terrifyingly shallow.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801444","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00048","en":"When I come to notice, my breath is becoming frightfully shallow.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","grammar"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that when he notices, his breathing has already become frighteningly shallow. The English uses malformed present narration and changes the completed change into an ongoing one.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":44,"start":0,"text":"When I come to notice, my breath is becoming"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000c62:text","row":30643,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"意識が霞んできた。","en":"My consciousness begins to cloud over.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801445","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00049","en":"My awareness became a dim haze.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000c8c:text","row":30644,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"霧の悲鳴が聞こえた。","en":"I hear Kiri scream.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801446","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00050","en":"I could hear Kiri shrieking.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000cb8:text","row":30645,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"ガラスの割れる音。","en":"The sound of breaking glass.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801447","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00051","en":"The sound of glass being cracked.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The Japanese gives the sound of glass breaking. 'Being cracked' suggests a crack forming without the glass necessarily breaking apart.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":32,"start":13,"text":"glass being cracked"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000ce2:text","row":30646,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"視界の外、何かが、肉に、食いこんだ。","en":"Outside my field of vision, something bites into flesh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801448","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00052","en":"Out of sight... something had... eaten down... into flesh.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","tense_aspect"],"assessment":"食いこむ means that something bites or digs into flesh. The English literalizes the verb as eating and uses past perfect for the immediate event.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":57,"start":26,"text":"had... eaten down... into flesh"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000d26:text","row":30647,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「はっはっはっはっはっはっ―――は―――」","en":"“Hah hah hah hah hah hah—hah—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801449","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00053","en":"Taichi: \"HahHahHahHahHahHah---hah---\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000d68:text","row":30648,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"唐突に呼吸が停止した。","en":"My breathing stops abruptly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801450","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00054","en":"Suddenly the breathing came to a halt.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that his breathing abruptly stops. The English removes the embodied possessor and uses a stilted nominal predicate.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":37,"start":9,"text":"the breathing came to a halt"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000d96:text","row":30649,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"眼球が濁ったかのように、暗くなっていく。","en":"My vision darkens, as though my eyeballs have clouded over.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801451","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00055","en":"Eyeballs went dark, as if covered with mud.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"眼球が濁ったかのように means as though his eyes themselves had clouded over. The English misreads 濁る literally as being coated in mud.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":42,"start":20,"text":"as if covered with mud"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000dd6:text","row":30650,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"最後の瞬間、","en":"At the final instant,","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801452","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00056","en":"That final instant,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000e24:text","row":30651,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「……！」","en":"“…!”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801453","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00057","en":"Youko: \"...!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0227:00000e46:text","row":30652,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"彼女を見た。","en":"I see her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:801454","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0101:00058","en":"I saw her.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
